stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Submitted : citizen submits (reference ID generated, AI analysis stored)
  Submitted --> UnderReview : CMO reviews / forwards to department
  UnderReview --> UnderReview : CMO reassigns · officer returns to CMO
  UnderReview --> InProgress : officer starts investigation
  InProgress --> InProgress : progress updates · ATR submitted · CMO returns ATR
  InProgress --> Resolved : CMO accepts action-taken report
  UnderReview --> Resolved : CMO closes at CMO level
  Resolved --> Reopened : citizen reopens (≤ 30 days)
  Reopened --> UnderReview : CMO reviews / re-forwards
  Resolved --> [*] : citizen feedback
  state "Under Review" as UnderReview
  state "In Progress" as InProgress
